File: contrib/libtests/pngunknown.c
Line: 363
Function: ancillary
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: The function indexes name[0..3] without validating that the provided 'name' points to at least 4 bytes. Passing a shorter string leads to out-of-bounds reads when constructing the 32-bit chunk code.

